// Public API of :sdk: the public and protected classes and members of its release AAR, as javap prints them.
// Classes in a package named internal are left out. ./gradlew :sdk:apiDump writes this file, and
// ./gradlew check fails when the AAR no longer matches it. A change here needs a line in CHANGELOG.md that tells
// integrators what changed.

